title: Go to Bavaria
new-page: true
is-special: true
face-image: img/land/Bavaria.svg.webp
on-arrival: {!
  setTimeout(function() {
    var el = document.getElementById('bavaria');
    if (!el || typeof d3 === 'undefined' || !window.ParliamentData) return;
    el.removeAttribute('data-parliament');
    el.innerHTML = '';
    window.ParliamentData.renderParliament('bavaria', el);
  }, 0);
!}

= Bavaria

Bavaria is one of the most conservative and catholic states. It is historically associated with the Bavarian Zentrum, now BVP, that has always highlighted a unique cultural identity.

More recently Bavaria has been the showplace of multiple consecutive council republics that were ultimately replaced by the Free State.

Currently ruled by plhl (party) in a [+ bavaria_gov +]-Coalition with [+ bavaria_support +]% support.





<div id="bavaria" style="width:500px; height:250px;"></div>






